{
  "_id": "x6j7rwgN38X4lFea",
  "name": "Tutorial Floor Experiences",
  "img": "icons/svg/d20-grey.svg",
  "description": "<p><em>Rulebook Table 28 (p.118).</em> Roll or choose one of the six sub-tables below to generate a Tutorial Floor background experience (used during character creation, or as a GM-inspiration seed for early-campaign flashbacks and NPC hooks). Each sub-table result grants two Skills of your choice (roll 1d4 and 1d2 for starting Ranks) fitting the theme, plus a narrative. Two further tables, not part of this d6 choice, cover the Third and Fourth Floors: Table 35: Third Floor Events (p.126) and Table 36: Fourth Floor Events (p.127).</p><p>Note: Foundry's default RollTable draw follows a document-linked result into a sub-table automatically (the \"recursive\" draw option), so drawing this table may report both hops (the chooser result, then the sub-table's own result) in a single draw.</p>",
